  "title": "Plan mode for AI sessions",
  "summary": "Plan mode is a read-only autonomy posture for AI sessions, picked from the chat footer. The assistant can only investigate; anything that writes, runs or deploys is refused until it hands over a plan and you approve it, which restores the posture you were in before. Session chats only, and never persisted.",
